Inspect existing hosted-agent Tasks without creating, changing, or selecting a Task.

Usage
  azd ai agent tasks [command]

Available Commands
  list : List one page of Tasks for a hosted agent.
  show : Show a Task by its exact ID.

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string         : Sets the current working directory
      --debug              : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help               : help for tasks
      --no-prompt          : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string      : The output format (default "default")

Examples
    azd ai agent tasks list
    azd ai agent tasks show <task-id>

Use azd ai agent tasks [command] --help to view examples and more information about a specific command.
